<title>RUSSIA: Lukoil first half oil output rises 0.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Lukoil first half oil output rises 0.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>NK LUKoil, Russia's biggest oil company, said its oil output in the first six months of this year was 1.15 million barrels per day, 0.8 percent higher than a year earlier.</p>
<p>&quot;The results of LUKoil's work in the first half of 1996 reflect a continuing trend towards stabilisation of the Company's production,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
</text>
